@GapSense.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5120
@DemoLecturerId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Health: list risk thresholds
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/RiskThresholds
Accept: application/json

###
### Lecturer profiles
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/LecturerProfiles
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/LecturerProfiles/{{DemoLecturerId}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Academic settings by lecturer (demo seed)
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/LecturerAcademicSettings/by-lecturer/{{DemoLecturerId}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Notification preferences (email toggles — not the bell inbox)
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/LecturerNotificationSettings/by-lecturer/{{DemoLecturerId}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Security settings (password hash not returned)
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/LecturerSecuritySettings/by-lecturer/{{DemoLecturerId}}
Accept: application/json

###
### In-app notifications (bell / notifications page)
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/Notifications?lecturerProfileId={{DemoLecturerId}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/api/Notifications/unread-count?lecturerProfileId={{DemoLecturerId}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Swagger UI
GET {{GapSense.API_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html
